# Copy to `.env` and fill in. Never commit real keys.
#
# ArcGIS API key used by the example app and by `configureArcgis`.
# API keys embedded in mobile apps are recoverable — use a narrowly scoped key
# with referrer/usage restrictions configured in your ArcGIS account.
EXPO_PUBLIC_ARCGIS_API_KEY=your-scoped-arcgis-api-key
